1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:02,550
Kabhi aasman mein aeroplane ke peeche

2
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:04,200
ye lambi white line dekhi hai?

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,800
Kya plane aasman mein dhuaan chhod raha hai?

4
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:08,050
Ya phir kuch aur?

5
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:09,150
Interesting baat...

6
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:12,250
ye line har aeroplane ke peeche nahi dikhti.

7
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,600
Kabhi ye kuch seconds mein gayab ho jaati hai...

8
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,900
aur kabhi ghanton tak aasman mein bani rehti hai!

9
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:18,600
Actually, ise kehte hain Contrail

10
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,900
yaani Condensation Trail!

11
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,000
Jab jet engine se nikli garam,

12
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,900
water-vapour wali exhaust

13
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,800
bahut thandi hawa se milti hai,

14
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,100
toh tiny ice crystals ban jaate hain.

15
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,750
Aur wahi humein aasman mein

16
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,300
white line ki tarah dikhte hain.

17
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,550
Lekin twist ye hai — contrail kitni der rahegi,

18
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:36,980
ye mainly depend karta hai

19
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:39,150
upper atmosphere ki humidity par.

20
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:40,850
Dry air mein jaldi gayab,

21
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:43,200
aur humid air mein kaafi der tak reh sakti hai!

22
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:44,750
Ab ek tricky question!

23
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,750
Kya aeroplane ki white contrails

24
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,850
Earth ke climate ko affect kar sakti hain?

25
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:51,230
Answer comment mein batayein.

26
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,280
A, B ya C comment karo

27
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:56,030
aur Defence Pathshala ko follow karna mat bhoolna!
